(7756883, 1283491, 173844, '<td valign="top">As if made to order.  The journey begins wide open at the dark and white patterned tiles, through the sharp architecture, the person with a cart striding towards the opening of a hidden street and out into the dark sky.  Cunningly doing the bidding of the wizard behind the camera.  The tiles do the heavy lifting. I want to see this movie.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'As if made to order.  The journey begins wide open at the dark and white patterned tiles, through the sharp architecture, the person with a cart striding towards the opening of a hidden street and out into the dark sky.  Cunningly doing the bidding of the wizard behind the camera.  The tiles do the heavy lifting. I want to see this movie.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2023-08-28 00:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7756884, 1283504, 173844, '<td valign="top">Seemingly simple. Aside from the hawk gracefully lifting up, it''s neat how the rest of the contrast is among rather soft tones.  The background is of gentle wheat, blue and an arc of white clouds.  The main contrast lives in the fence, the whites and shadows.  Whereas most images aiming for contrast can be heard through a bullhorn of stark juxtaposition, this is serene and therefore surprisingly effective.</td>', 'Seemingly simple. Aside from the hawk gracefully lifting up, it''s neat how the rest of the contrast is among rather soft tones.  The background is of gentle wheat, blue and an arc of white clouds.  The main contrast lives in the fence, the whites and shadows.  Whereas most images aiming for contrast can be heard through a bullhorn of stark juxtaposition, this is serene and therefore surprisingly effective.', '2023-08-28 00:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7756885, 1283336, 173844, '<td valign="top">The light on the table and chairs, and the sparkle of the glassware, arise glowing from the softish shadows of the rest of the area.  It''s a sunlight smile inching the day along.  The modesty makes this all the more appealing.</td>', 'The light on the table and chairs, and the sparkle of the glassware, arise glowing from the softish shadows of the rest of the area.  It''s a sunlight smile inching the day along.  The modesty makes this all the more appealing.', '2023-08-28 00:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7756886, 1283515, 68504, '<td valign="top">!</td>', '!', '2023-08-28 00:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7756887, 1283296, 68504, '<td valign="top">stunning. excellent use of high contrast. more than ten, but it is what it is.</td>', 'stunning. excellent use of high contrast. more than ten, but it is what it is.', '2023-08-28 00:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7756888, 1283534, 68504, '<td valign="top">when is a fish not a fish? you decide.</td>', 'when is a fish not a fish? you decide.', '2023-08-28 00:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7756889, 1283508, 173844, '<td valign="top">A very strong, becoming contrast concoction, I find this even more fascinating as an abstract composition.  The symmetry needs wresting from the overall scene, and it''s well worth the effort.</td>', 'A very strong, becoming contrast concoction, I find this even more fascinating as an abstract composition.  The symmetry needs wresting from the overall scene, and it''s well worth the effort.', '2023-08-28 00:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
