(7756892, 1283296, 173844, '<td valign="top">A high key image gone heavily contrasty.  Her hair, eyes, clothing and shadows herald the movement into a new genre, perhaps.  The hidden mysteries of her being contrast with the otherwise open portrayal.  Engaging and moving.</td>', 'A high key image gone heavily contrasty.  Her hair, eyes, clothing and shadows herald the movement into a new genre, perhaps.  The hidden mysteries of her being contrast with the otherwise open portrayal.  Engaging and moving.', '2023-08-28 00:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
